title: JohnnyStart
---
<<declare $npcName3 = "Johnny">> //The NPC's name will go here and can be different for each NPC if needed

{$npcName3}: Hello, I'm Johnny. I don't have a welcome yet. But hopefully I will soon.
-> <i>Listen to their story</i>
    <<jump JohnnyStory>>
-> <i>Ask about their day</i>
    <<jump JohnnyDay>>
-> <i>Back to the lobby</i>
===

title: JohnnyStory
---
Do you want to listen to the story?
-> <i>Yes</i>
    <<jump JohnnyStoryStart>>
-> <i>No</i>
===

title: JohnnyStoryStart
---
<<wait 4>>
===

title: JohnnyDay
---
{$npcName3}: My day has been pretty uneventful so far. I try to do as many activities during the day to make every day as interesting and fun as possible. That's why I'm here today.
-> It's always good to keep busy.
    <<jump JohnnyGood>>
-> Don't forget to take a break every now and then.
    <<jump JohnnyNeutral>>
-> Don't really see a museum tour as fun.
    <<jump JohnnyBad>>
===

title: JohnnyGood
---
{$npcName3}: That it is. I get bored pretty easily so I try to occupy myself often.
===

title: JohnnyNeutral
---
{$npcName3}: Of course! We all need to take a moment to relax.
===

title: JohnnyBad
---
{$npcName3}: That's pretty rude. It may not be fun to many, but it is to me.
===